WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:47.410
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.680 --> 01:49.840
Since we're all Chinese,

3
01:50.120 --> 01:51.400
so I came over to say hello.

4
01:53.359 --> 01:55.000
Chinese or foreigner...

5
01:55.599 --> 01:56.879
Does that make any difference here?

6
01:59.680 --> 02:01.000
The locals here...

7
02:01.640 --> 02:03.560
look down on outsiders like us.

8
02:04.879 --> 02:07.040
The guy you fought is named Kano.

9
02:07.719 --> 02:09.039
He's extremely jealous.

10
02:09.400 --> 02:10.319
Watch your back.

11
02:11.479 --> 02:12.800
You think he can take me?

12
02:17.039 --> 02:17.960
What are you in for?

13
02:19.080 --> 02:20.039
None of your business.

14
02:22.599 --> 02:23.919
In a place like this,

15
02:24.879 --> 02:25.840
without friends,

16
02:26.360 --> 02:27.599
trying to stay alive...

17
02:28.599 --> 02:29.240
is tough.

18
02:37.360 --> 02:38.199
I get it.

19
02:39.199 --> 02:41.879
You're in trouble with no backup.

20
02:42.520 --> 02:43.000
Right.

21
02:43.439 --> 02:44.759
I don't have time to make friends.

22
02:51.000 --> 02:52.400
Didn't we get locked up just for him?

23
02:52.599 --> 02:53.280
Playing hard to get.

24
02:55.639 --> 02:57.000
No time to make friends?

25
02:58.639 --> 03:00.159
Are you interested in money, then?

26
03:04.080 --> 03:05.599
Who isn't interested in money?

27
03:10.199 --> 03:11.639
I'm in here for robbery.

28
03:15.400 --> 03:16.960
As far as I know,

29
03:16.960 --> 03:18.960
this place only holds serious felons.

30
03:19.199 --> 03:20.159
Robbery?

31
03:22.240 --> 03:24.719
You... you think we just went after

32
03:24.719 --> 03:26.360
petty street cash?

33
03:26.840 --> 03:29.280
If we hadn't alerted The Four Great Families,

34
03:29.719 --> 03:33.479
we'd have taken the cash and run.

35
03:37.280 --> 03:39.919
To make that much noise,

36
03:40.560 --> 03:41.919
you must be no small players.

37
03:46.599 --> 03:47.080
Boss,

38
03:47.680 --> 03:49.080
what did you get locked up for?

39
03:50.680 --> 03:51.159
Framed.

40
03:57.080 --> 03:58.240
Framed? You...

41
04:00.560 --> 04:02.800
You'd better save that line

42
04:03.199 --> 04:06.199
for the higher-ups.

43
04:08.400 --> 04:08.879
Wait,

44
04:09.159 --> 04:11.560
asking if we're interested in money,

45
04:12.000 --> 04:12.840
what did you mean?

46
04:17.040 --> 04:18.560
I'm a businessman.

47
04:19.879 --> 04:22.360
If we can get out of here together,

48
04:23.560 --> 04:24.639
I can promise you...

49
04:24.759 --> 04:25.639
Come on, brother,

50
04:27.120 --> 04:28.480
if I could get out of here,

51
04:29.360 --> 04:30.560
I'd make you a cop.

52
04:34.360 --> 04:36.279
Do you think standing on that high wall

53
04:36.480 --> 04:37.279
is comfortable?

54
04:40.319 --> 04:41.040
Let me tell you,

55
04:42.720 --> 04:44.199
if we can break out of here,

56
04:44.240 --> 04:46.240
I guarantee you'll make big money.

57
04:48.560 --> 04:49.199
Big money?

58
04:50.639 --> 04:51.240
Boss,

59
04:52.160 --> 04:54.120
do you have a fever,

60
04:54.120 --> 04:55.560
or are you dreaming?

61
04:56.639 --> 04:57.800
We're...

62
04:58.319 --> 05:00.959
we're in Cyrano Prison right now.

63
05:01.439 --> 05:04.199
This place holds maximum-security inmates.

64
05:04.480 --> 05:05.639
You think we can

65
05:07.040 --> 05:07.879
just walk out of here?

66
05:10.000 --> 05:10.800
I noticed

67
05:11.439 --> 05:14.319
you know how to handle the guards here.

68
05:15.480 --> 05:16.399
My wife is outside.

69
05:17.160 --> 05:18.439
If your boys

70
05:18.920 --> 05:20.680
can get in touch with my wife,

71
05:21.319 --> 05:22.959
and grease the guards' palms,

72
05:23.399 --> 05:24.720
getting out won't be a problem.

73
05:25.560 --> 05:26.199
As for money,

74
05:26.639 --> 05:27.720
that's even less of an issue.

75
05:35.360 --> 05:36.720
Look, buddy,

76
05:37.319 --> 05:38.480
whatever you said today,

77
05:38.920 --> 05:40.040
I didn't hear a word.

78
05:41.120 --> 05:41.920
Move, move, let's go.

79
06:00.600 --> 06:01.560
All the details

80
06:01.800 --> 06:03.160
are documented in my report.

81
06:03.439 --> 06:05.959
Chen Hai formed Runze Commerce 2 years ago

82
06:06.279 --> 06:08.720
signing an equity deal with Longze Group.

83
06:08.959 --> 06:10.720
Longze Group holds a 30% stake,

84
06:11.120 --> 06:12.959
providing business consulting

85
06:12.959 --> 06:13.800
and management services.

86
06:13.800 --> 06:14.800
But in reality,

87
06:14.920 --> 06:16.839
Longze Group hasn't actually

88
06:16.839 --> 06:18.279
taken part in Runze Commerce's operations.

89
06:18.720 --> 06:19.959
Over the past year,

90
06:20.800 --> 06:23.199
a large amount of Runze Commerce's funds

91
06:23.480 --> 06:25.360
was wired through Longze Group to

92
06:25.360 --> 06:26.839
Singapore's Weiyuan International Trade.

93
06:27.600 --> 06:28.680
I see what you mean.

94
06:29.519 --> 06:32.360
Chen Hai is using Longze Group

95
06:32.879 --> 06:36.120
to legally avoid taxes for Runze Commerce.

96
06:36.360 --> 06:39.160
But I already knew that beforehand.

97
06:42.000 --> 06:43.720
On paper,

98
06:44.240 --> 06:45.160
what he's doing

99
06:45.759 --> 06:47.439
hasn't caused our group

100
06:47.439 --> 06:48.680
any losses.

101
06:49.000 --> 06:52.519
In fact, it boosted our profit scale.

102
06:53.199 --> 06:54.839
But we know

103
06:54.839 --> 06:55.879
absolutely nothing about Runze Commerce.

104
06:56.000 --> 06:56.879
Take last year, for instance.

105
06:58.000 --> 06:59.040
Even when the solar PV industry

106
06:59.040 --> 07:00.480
suffered a severe downturn,

107
07:00.639 --> 07:02.759
Weiyuan International still bought

108
07:02.800 --> 07:04.759
many solar panels through Runze Commerce.

109
07:05.079 --> 07:06.240
It defies all logic.

110
07:08.399 --> 07:10.839
The group holds shares in many companies

111
07:10.839 --> 07:11.560
with the aim of

112
07:11.920 --> 07:12.959
expanding

113
07:12.959 --> 07:14.800
the group's overall scale,

114
07:15.040 --> 07:16.319
so we can go public sooner.

115
07:18.079 --> 07:20.439
As for how these companies make money,

116
07:20.879 --> 07:22.720
there's no need to interfere too much.

117
07:23.160 --> 07:23.720
Of course,

118
07:24.480 --> 07:26.279
once we fully acquire Runze Commerce,

119
07:26.360 --> 07:27.680
the company will naturally step up

120
07:27.680 --> 07:29.319
its oversight and management.

121
07:30.199 --> 07:31.319
But the fund transfers of Runze Commerce

122
07:31.319 --> 07:32.920
with Weiyuan International Trade

123
07:32.920 --> 07:33.959
are highly suspicious.

124
07:33.959 --> 07:35.879
Alright, that's enough.

125
07:37.160 --> 07:38.360
The company brought you in

126
07:39.199 --> 07:41.240
mainly out of concern that Chen Hai

127
07:41.839 --> 07:43.240
was committing embezzlement.

128
07:43.879 --> 07:45.879
Since you've looked into it

129
07:46.160 --> 07:47.639
and found no such problem,

130
07:48.240 --> 07:50.600
I can report back to the chairman.

131
07:52.040 --> 07:53.439
As for you, moving forward,

132
07:54.439 --> 07:56.279
just focus on doing your own job.

133
07:56.800 --> 07:58.000
As for other matters,

134
07:58.680 --> 07:59.959
don't worry about them anymore.

135
08:01.279 --> 08:01.839
I'm sorry.

136
08:02.480 --> 08:03.759
Chairman Long brought me here

137
08:04.120 --> 08:06.360
specifically to look into these details.

138
08:07.199 --> 08:08.600
Since I'm in this position,

139
08:09.040 --> 08:11.319
I must verify every company transaction

140
08:12.079 --> 08:15.800
and ensure it's legitimate and legal.

141
08:18.240 --> 08:19.560
Legitimate and legal?

142
08:22.959 --> 08:24.240
What do you mean?

143
08:25.800 --> 08:26.639
I suspect

144
08:27.720 --> 08:29.720
Chen Hai uses us for money laundering.

145
08:34.759 --> 08:35.159
How confident are you

146
08:36.480 --> 08:37.759
in your assessment?

147
08:39.679 --> 08:41.320
How confident are you

148
08:43.039 --> 08:44.360
If my assessment is wrong,

149
08:44.919 --> 08:45.879
I will take the blame and resign.

150
08:49.519 --> 08:51.799
Something this huge happened in the group,

151
08:52.440 --> 08:54.120
why didn't you tell me sooner?

152
08:59.080 --> 09:01.120
Because I wasn't completely certain before.

153
09:02.320 --> 09:03.919
But when I took my findings

154
09:03.960 --> 09:05.440
to confront Chen Hai,

155
09:05.840 --> 09:07.279
his reaction was very suspicious.

156
09:12.519 --> 09:13.039
Alright.

157
09:15.120 --> 09:16.600
Since you're so confident,

158
09:18.799 --> 09:20.399
then get to the bottom of it.

159
09:20.639 --> 09:22.279
The chairman entrusted the company to me.

160
09:23.200 --> 09:24.080
I won't let

161
09:24.960 --> 09:26.840
a massive group enterprise like this

162
09:27.320 --> 09:29.720
fall apart over a few bad apples.

163
09:31.679 --> 09:33.039
Infiltrating a large corporation

164
09:34.559 --> 09:38.559
to pull off illegal schemes under our noses...

165
09:40.000 --> 09:41.039
This Chen Hai

166
09:43.080 --> 09:44.159
is no simple character.

167
09:56.240 --> 09:57.000
Eat something.

168
09:58.559 --> 09:59.480
If you don't stay alive,

169
09:59.879 --> 10:01.399
how will you ever see your boyfriend again?

170
10:03.759 --> 10:05.919
People always need hope to keep living.

171
10:08.279 --> 10:10.600
You didn't take me to avenge your brother.

172
10:20.240 --> 10:21.960
What are you saying? I don't follow.

173
10:22.360 --> 10:23.519
You did it out of jealousy.

174
10:24.799 --> 10:26.120
Jealous that I love someone else.

175
10:26.840 --> 10:29.000
And the man I love happens to be a cop.

176
10:29.679 --> 10:31.159
That's the real reason you hate me.

177
10:35.639 --> 10:37.279
Don't think you know me so well.

178
10:40.159 --> 10:41.919
When you walked me home out of nowhere,

179
10:43.200 --> 10:44.120
did you actually think

180
10:44.759 --> 10:45.679
I would fall for you?

181
10:47.480 --> 10:49.240
That I'd ever be with someone like you?

182
10:50.840 --> 10:52.120
What kind of person am I?

183
10:52.440 --> 10:53.399
You're a criminal.

184
10:53.679 --> 10:54.679
A lunatic.

185
10:55.320 --> 10:58.279
A pathetic wretch no one will ever love.

186
11:00.559 --> 11:00.919
Fine.

187
11:03.840 --> 11:05.000
Between the two of us right now,

188
11:06.919 --> 11:08.000
who's more pathetic?

189
11:09.080 --> 11:10.080
You don't know me.

190
11:11.240 --> 11:12.159
I don't blame you.

191
11:13.639 --> 11:14.879
A lot of people call me evil.

192
11:15.799 --> 11:17.159
But in this world,

193
11:19.159 --> 11:21.080
who really wants to be the villain?

194
11:23.320 --> 11:25.120
You chose the path you took.

195
11:25.600 --> 11:26.600
Nobody forced you.

196
11:29.120 --> 11:30.799
You know the first time I went to prison,

197
11:31.240 --> 11:32.600
what it was for?

198
11:35.440 --> 11:37.039
The first time the cops hauled me away,

199
11:38.759 --> 11:40.559
it was for aggravated assault.

200
11:42.559 --> 11:43.960
The man I beat bloody

201
11:45.559 --> 11:46.759
was my own father.

202
11:50.639 --> 11:51.679
You're right.

203
11:52.759 --> 11:53.799
I am a lunatic.

204
11:55.559 --> 11:57.480
Because my father was a lunatic, too.

205
11:58.320 --> 11:59.879
Like father, like son.

206
12:02.519 --> 12:03.879
For as long as I can remember,

207
12:05.200 --> 12:07.360
I constantly watched my dad beat my mom.

208
12:08.519 --> 12:09.759
I was so small back then,

209
12:10.399 --> 12:11.399
terrified,

210
12:12.440 --> 12:14.159
without the courage to step in and stop him.

211
12:15.159 --> 12:16.720
All I could do was cower in a corner,

212
12:16.879 --> 12:19.000
watching my mom get beaten black and blue.

213
12:20.840 --> 12:22.840
Once I got a bit older and stronger,

214
12:23.799 --> 12:25.320
I threw myself between them.

215
12:25.320 --> 12:25.840
As I held him back,

216
12:25.840 --> 12:27.600
I begged him to stop hitting my mom.

217
12:27.879 --> 12:29.080
Instead, the belt in his hand

218
12:30.519 --> 12:32.399
lashed across my body, too.

219
12:34.960 --> 12:36.600
I was barely ten years old.

220
12:38.080 --> 12:38.919
A level of terror and rage

221
12:38.919 --> 12:41.720
that ordinary kids could never imagine

222
12:43.120 --> 12:44.919
was routine for me.

223
12:49.679 --> 12:51.080
When I was 17,

224
12:52.039 --> 12:53.639
I finally summoned the courage.

225
12:55.120 --> 12:56.320
With my bare fists,

226
12:56.960 --> 12:59.039
I took back dignity for my mom and myself.

227
13:02.000 --> 13:03.080
But ever since that day,

228
13:04.919 --> 13:06.919
I stepped onto a path of no return.

229
13:10.679 --> 13:13.000
That's just an excuse for your choices.

230
13:13.679 --> 13:15.120
If you thought your dad was a bad man,

231
13:16.159 --> 13:17.720
why didn't you choose to be good?

232
13:20.720 --> 13:22.840
The person I thought was the best

233
13:23.720 --> 13:24.799
betrayed me.

234
13:27.519 --> 13:29.679
The one who called the cops on me

235
13:30.519 --> 13:31.559
wasn't a stranger.

236
13:34.080 --> 13:35.159
It was my mom.

237
13:57.879 --> 13:59.240
That time I drove to pick you up

238
13:59.240 --> 14:00.320
and brought you home,

239
14:02.519 --> 14:04.000
I was so nervous.

240
14:06.080 --> 14:06.720
The entire drive,

241
14:06.720 --> 14:08.480
I didn't even know what I was saying.

242
14:10.080 --> 14:12.200
And I had no way to tell you who I was.

243
14:14.200 --> 14:15.960
But a night like that

244
14:17.879 --> 14:19.320
was, in my entire life,

245
14:20.159 --> 14:20.799
the happiest time.

246
14:20.799 --> 14:21.559
You know

247
14:22.639 --> 14:23.840
we could never be.

248
14:25.919 --> 14:27.759
I'm saying this just to tell you

249
14:29.480 --> 14:31.960
I still hold a shred of goodwill for you.

250
14:33.440 --> 14:34.799
I hope you won't use malice

251
14:34.799 --> 14:35.919
to repay my kindness.

252
14:37.039 --> 14:38.679
Right now, I want you to stay alive.

253
14:39.960 --> 14:41.960
And I want you to see with your own eyes

254
14:42.480 --> 14:43.759
the person you love

255
14:45.159 --> 14:46.480
die by my hands.

256
14:52.000 --> 14:53.320
You'll definitely lose to him.

257
14:54.120 --> 14:55.519
Until it's over,

258
14:56.360 --> 14:57.039
you can't be sure.

259
14:59.519 --> 15:00.519
You'll regret this.

260
15:01.600 --> 15:02.639
Then stay alive,

261
15:03.679 --> 15:05.679
and wait for the day I regret it.

262
15:10.399 --> 15:10.840
Come on.

263
15:12.519 --> 15:13.279
Untie me.

264
15:13.879 --> 15:14.559
I'll eat on my own.

265
15:17.759 --> 15:18.679
If you don't want me to die,

266
15:20.679 --> 15:21.519
then untie me.

267
15:43.879 --> 15:44.399
Eat up.

268
16:27.039 --> 16:27.679
Let me go!

269
16:37.399 --> 16:38.159
Let go of me!

270
16:39.120 --> 16:40.000
Let me go!

271
16:40.240 --> 16:40.600
Let—

272
16:52.720 --> 16:53.320
If anyone dares come closer,

273
16:53.320 --> 16:54.080
I'll die right here!

274
16:54.240 --> 16:55.039
Stay away from me!

275
16:57.360 --> 16:58.080
Go ahead and die, then!

276
17:00.240 --> 17:01.080
Do it!

277
17:04.680 --> 17:05.559
Nobody's stopping you!

278
17:09.079 --> 17:09.839
If you don't have the guts,

279
17:10.880 --> 17:12.279
don't stand here acting tough!

280
17:23.839 --> 17:24.519
Why?

281
17:25.640 --> 17:27.759
Why are you doing this to me?

282
17:27.920 --> 17:29.240
Why?

283
17:30.200 --> 17:31.519
Why?

284
17:37.519 --> 17:38.759
Let go! Let me go!

285
17:47.720 --> 17:48.799
Liang Wenbiao called.

286
17:48.960 --> 17:50.039
He wants us to make the deal tomorrow.

287
17:52.680 --> 17:53.759
It's about time.

288
17:54.599 --> 17:55.400
What I asked you to prepare,

289
17:55.400 --> 17:56.079
is it ready?

290
19:21.680 --> 19:22.079
Here.

291
19:24.920 --> 19:26.480
Tomorrow's deal is a suicide mission.

292
19:27.160 --> 19:28.240
Whether I make it out alive

293
19:29.200 --> 19:30.119
depends on you.

294
20:06.680 --> 20:07.319
President Jiang.

295
20:08.079 --> 20:09.160
What's so confidential

296
20:10.240 --> 20:11.200
that you had to meet me here?

297
20:12.319 --> 20:13.440
Look what you've done!

298
20:14.319 --> 20:16.160
I don't follow you, President Jiang.

299
20:17.200 --> 20:19.640
You're only in Longze Group because of me.

300
20:20.079 --> 20:22.559
Runze Commerce joined Longze Group

301
20:22.720 --> 20:24.799
only because I asked the chairman.

302
20:25.799 --> 20:27.200
I never in my wildest dreams expected

303
20:27.519 --> 20:28.720
you'd be audacious enough

304
20:29.400 --> 20:31.680
to use Longze Group for money laundering!

305
20:32.000 --> 20:32.400
Have you...

306
20:33.240 --> 20:34.839
Have you completely lost your mind?

307
20:36.599 --> 20:38.759
President Jiang, your reaction right now

308
20:39.039 --> 20:40.279
really comes as a surprise.

309
20:42.119 --> 20:43.079
What do you mean?

310
20:43.640 --> 20:45.799
Between Runze Commerce and Longze Group's

311
20:45.799 --> 20:47.880
other subsidiaries, every transaction

312
20:47.920 --> 20:49.920
went directly through your hands.

313
20:51.880 --> 20:53.440
When you took my money back then,

314
20:53.960 --> 20:55.720
you just turned a blind eye.

315
20:57.240 --> 20:58.759
Now that Gu Xiaoyi is here,

316
20:59.359 --> 21:00.640
you want to trim your sails?

317
21:01.160 --> 21:01.640
You...

318
21:03.079 --> 21:04.720
You told me back then

319
21:05.000 --> 21:07.440
it was to fix Runze Commerce's tax issues!

320
21:08.079 --> 21:08.440
But...

321
21:09.039 --> 21:11.640
All these illegal schemes behind my back,

322
21:11.880 --> 21:13.640
you never mentioned a word of them to me!

323
21:13.640 --> 21:14.039
Give me a break.

324
21:14.279 --> 21:15.359
Stop playing the innocent victim with me.

325
21:15.880 --> 21:17.039
What Runze Commerce was doing,

326
21:17.039 --> 21:17.920
you knew full well all along.

327
21:17.920 --> 21:18.319
What?

328
21:19.480 --> 21:20.599
You pocket the benefits when it suits you,

329
21:20.759 --> 21:21.480
and now that trouble hits,

330
21:21.839 --> 21:23.000
you want to wash your hands clean?

331
21:24.160 --> 21:24.960
Chen Hai, Chen Hai...

332
21:25.720 --> 21:26.799
We're old classmates,

333
21:27.160 --> 21:28.119
lifelong friends!

334
21:28.440 --> 21:28.799
I...

335
21:28.960 --> 21:31.200
I helped you. You can't ruin me!

336
21:32.000 --> 21:32.680
All right, that's enough.

337
21:33.799 --> 21:34.960
Let's both stop putting on an act.

338
21:36.000 --> 21:38.880
You just keep being an executive director,

339
21:39.640 --> 21:40.359
and regarding my business,

340
21:40.599 --> 21:42.119
keep pretending you know nothing.

341
21:43.720 --> 21:44.400
Rest assured,

342
21:45.079 --> 21:46.359
even if I get exposed one day,

343
21:47.279 --> 21:48.519
I won't drag you down with me.

344
21:48.960 --> 21:51.279
After all, I don't sell out my own people.

345
21:53.440 --> 21:54.680
Besides, if things truly go south,

346
21:54.880 --> 21:55.759
turning you in

347
21:55.960 --> 21:57.680
would only add another charge to my list.

348
21:57.680 --> 21:58.559
What good does that do me?

349
21:59.559 --> 21:59.960
Then...

350
22:01.559 --> 22:03.079
What do you plan to do next?

351
22:06.160 --> 22:07.680
She's just a CFO.

352
22:08.240 --> 22:09.759
Teach her a harsh lesson,

353
22:10.160 --> 22:11.960
and she'll learn her place.

354
22:14.039 --> 22:15.880
You're going to target Gu Xiaoyi?

355
22:19.160 --> 22:19.519
You...

356
22:37.039 --> 22:37.440
Thanks.

357
22:38.720 --> 22:40.200
The deal is set for 10:00 AM tomorrow

358
22:40.559 --> 22:42.400
at the New Town Plaza underground garage.

359
22:42.960 --> 22:43.920
New Town Plaza?

360
22:44.680 --> 22:45.119
Are you sure?

361
22:45.319 --> 22:46.519
Liang Wenbiao said it himself.

362
22:50.160 --> 22:52.200
Last time Li Qiang and Liang Wenbiao met,

363
22:52.200 --> 22:54.000
the deal was set at the Financial Tower.

364
22:55.039 --> 22:57.319
Liang Wenbiao thinks we're tailing him.

365
22:58.400 --> 22:59.599
Why would he choose

366
22:59.839 --> 23:01.960
a public place for the deal again?

367
23:02.160 --> 23:03.640
Maybe Xiao Kang's death

368
23:03.920 --> 23:05.000
dispelled his suspicions.

369
23:09.559 --> 23:10.799
During the last deal,

370
23:11.599 --> 23:13.160
a suspicious vehicle appeared.

371
23:13.960 --> 23:15.640
Tomorrow's deal won't be simple either.

372
23:16.160 --> 23:17.079
You must be careful.

373
23:17.640 --> 23:18.039
Also,

374
23:18.440 --> 23:20.359
we can't rule out a location change.

375
23:20.640 --> 23:22.079
Stay in touch with us at all times.

376
23:22.359 --> 23:22.759
Got it.

377
23:27.240 --> 23:28.240
Here's what you wanted.

378
23:31.960 --> 23:33.200
We can finally close the net.

379
23:33.920 --> 23:34.400
Yeah.

380
23:35.799 --> 23:37.000
We've finally reached this day.

381
23:38.279 --> 23:38.880
Good work.

382
23:44.759 --> 23:46.039
Arresting Li Qiang tomorrow

383
23:46.480 --> 23:49.079
concerns Tian Xin, Zhuang Yan,

384
23:49.720 --> 23:51.319
and Ge Dan's safety.

385
23:52.839 --> 23:54.119
Let's hope everything goes smoothly.

386
24:37.000 --> 24:38.640
You've made quite an improvement.

387
24:40.160 --> 24:42.319
It's all thanks to you, Uncle Lin.

388
24:43.839 --> 24:45.880
What could I possibly teach you?

389
24:47.759 --> 24:49.440
If anything, you should be teaching me.

390
24:52.079 --> 24:54.480
As for that parking lot proposal...

391
24:55.119 --> 24:55.960
I took a look.

392
24:55.960 --> 24:56.799
It's really good.

393
24:57.640 --> 25:00.200
I'll have my assistant contact you.

394
25:00.599 --> 25:01.160
Great.

395
25:01.440 --> 25:02.279
Thank you, Uncle Lin.

396
25:04.440 --> 25:04.880
President Long.

397
25:05.279 --> 25:05.720
You have a call.

398
25:08.079 --> 25:09.559
Excuse me, I need to take this.

399
25:09.759 --> 25:10.400
Sure.

400
25:10.960 --> 25:12.359
I'll wait for you at the diner.

401
25:12.359 --> 25:12.640
Okay.

402
25:17.519 --> 25:18.079
Honey.

403
25:19.039 --> 25:20.480
Chen Hai is definitely dirty.

404
25:20.559 --> 25:22.519
But President Jiang wants to downplay it.

405
25:24.240 --> 25:25.920
I'll call Jiang Shan.

406
25:27.039 --> 25:28.319
Just do what you think is right.

407
25:29.279 --> 25:31.559
Behavior that harms our group...

408
25:31.920 --> 25:33.039
...will never be tolerated.

409
25:33.480 --> 25:34.519
Longze Group

410
25:34.960 --> 25:36.400
will never take the fall for anyone

411
25:36.799 --> 25:38.359
breaking the law.

412
25:39.640 --> 25:40.920
Do what needs to be done.

413
25:41.599 --> 25:43.079
I'll back you up 100 percent.

414
25:43.960 --> 25:45.759
Okay, understood.

415
26:32.079 --> 26:33.319
We interrupt with breaking news.

416
26:33.880 --> 26:35.200
In Dongfang Park, police

417
26:35.200 --> 26:37.000
found the bodies of a man and a woman.

418
26:37.240 --> 26:39.319
The victims' identities have been confirmed.

419
26:39.519 --> 26:41.359
Police are stepping up their investigation.

420
26:41.680 --> 26:43.720
We remind all drivers

421
26:43.880 --> 26:45.359
to stay safe on the road.

422
26:45.680 --> 26:47.839
If in danger, call the police right away.

423
27:24.319 --> 27:24.799
Get out of the car!

424
27:25.319 --> 27:26.519
Get out! Out of the car!

425
27:27.400 --> 27:29.440
Hurry up! Get out of the car!

426
27:32.519 --> 27:33.599
Come on, get out, now!

427
27:35.200 --> 27:36.799
Hello, is this the police?

428
27:38.039 --> 27:40.000
I'm on Shuncheng Avenue! I'm being attacked!

429
27:46.400 --> 27:46.880
Get out!

430
27:47.200 --> 27:48.039
What do you want?!

431
27:48.680 --> 27:49.119
Get out!

432
27:53.240 --> 27:54.599
Wait, who are you people?!

433
27:54.680 --> 27:55.200
Shut up.

434
28:00.359 --> 28:01.480
Miss Gu.

435
28:02.480 --> 28:04.119
Someone asked me to pass along a message.

436
28:05.440 --> 28:06.480
If it's none of your business,

437
28:07.000 --> 28:07.880
stay out of it.

438
28:09.880 --> 28:10.839
Who the hell are you?!

439
28:11.319 --> 28:12.799
I could tell you who I am,

440
28:13.400 --> 28:15.559
but it's not time yet.

441
28:16.680 --> 28:18.920
Because you don't have to die tonight.

442
28:21.640 --> 28:22.160
Just remember,

443
28:22.920 --> 28:24.240
play with fire and you'll get burned.

444
28:25.440 --> 28:26.359
Watch your step.

445
28:38.400 --> 28:39.160
Help!

446
28:39.599 --> 28:40.319
Help!

447
28:40.720 --> 28:41.440
Save me!

448
28:42.000 --> 28:42.960
Help me!

449
28:46.599 --> 28:48.119
None of your business. Get lost!

450
28:52.519 --> 28:53.359
I'm talking to you!

451
28:53.759 --> 28:54.559
Told you, stay out of this!

452
28:54.559 --> 28:55.240
Get lost!

453
29:02.799 --> 29:03.279
Get him!

454
29:33.440 --> 29:34.480
I'll remember you.

455
29:34.799 --> 29:35.279
Let's go.

456
29:36.240 --> 29:37.519
Consider yourself lucky today.

457
29:52.359 --> 29:53.039
Are you all right?

458
29:54.119 --> 29:54.559
I'm fine.

459
29:55.079 --> 29:56.359
Thank you so much for earlier.

460
29:57.680 --> 29:58.599
Be careful from now on.

461
30:01.960 --> 30:03.160
What's your name?

462
30:04.039 --> 30:05.240
Whatever you do, don't tell the police

463
30:05.440 --> 30:06.160
you saw me.

464
30:28.440 --> 30:29.400
In other words,

465
30:29.559 --> 30:31.680
they didn't pull you over to rob you.

466
30:33.440 --> 30:33.920
No.

467
30:34.720 --> 30:37.000
They just said they were passing along a message.

468
30:37.400 --> 30:38.039
A message?

469
30:38.240 --> 30:39.000
What message?

470
30:40.000 --> 30:42.480
They told me to watch my step from now on.

471
30:44.160 --> 30:46.400
Have you offended anyone recently?

472
30:46.720 --> 30:48.759
Or is there anyone you suspect?

473
31:16.319 --> 31:16.880
You wanted to see me?

474
31:18.799 --> 31:19.279
Dana.

475
31:20.319 --> 31:21.640
The deal is happening soon.

476
31:22.440 --> 31:24.400
Why do I feel so uneasy?

477
31:26.200 --> 31:26.880
Same here.

478
31:28.000 --> 31:29.960
I think this kid Li Qiang is unreliable.

479
31:32.799 --> 31:34.000
I'm not talking about Li Qiang.

480
31:35.119 --> 31:37.039
I had you look into Wei Kai a while back.

481
31:37.799 --> 31:39.079
Did you find anything?

482
31:41.119 --> 31:41.720
Brother Biao,

483
31:43.000 --> 31:45.240
you suspect Wei Kai?

484
31:46.920 --> 31:47.799
That can't be.

485
31:48.240 --> 31:50.039
He was the one who shot Xiaokang.

486
31:55.359 --> 31:56.440
That may be so,

487
32:01.640 --> 32:02.599
but something feels off.

488
32:07.599 --> 32:08.839
At ten this morning,

489
32:09.480 --> 32:12.240
Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang will meet

490
32:12.240 --> 32:13.400
at New Town Plaza's underground garage.

491
32:13.880 --> 32:14.960
For this operation,

492
32:15.079 --> 32:17.319
we'll still split into Teams A, B, and C.

493
32:18.240 --> 32:21.559
Guan Qiang and Li Xiao lead Teams A and B,

494
32:21.839 --> 32:24.319
entering from Entrances One and Two

495
32:24.440 --> 32:25.279
of the parking lot.

496
32:25.960 --> 32:27.599
Captain Lu and I will lead Team C.

497
32:27.799 --> 32:29.359
From Liang Wenbiao's departure point,

498
32:29.559 --> 32:30.599
we'll conduct remote surveillance.

499
32:30.960 --> 32:33.160
We'll update his location in real time.

500
32:33.440 --> 32:35.799
Due to heavy traffic at New Town Plaza,

501
32:36.000 --> 32:38.359
CID will secure the outer perimeter.

502
32:38.599 --> 32:40.799
I want us to apprehend the suspects

503
32:40.799 --> 32:41.720
inside the parking lot.

504
32:42.720 --> 32:43.720
Regarding this operation,

505
32:44.000 --> 32:44.920
does anyone have any questions?

506
32:46.279 --> 32:48.279
We almost caught Li Qiang twice.

507
32:48.279 --> 32:49.680
He'll be extremely cautious this time.

508
32:50.240 --> 32:51.599
The parking lot has four access points.

509
32:51.759 --> 32:53.519
Once we control all of them,

510
32:53.640 --> 32:54.759
there'll be no way out for him.

511
32:55.480 --> 32:56.920
From what we know about Li Qiang,

512
32:57.359 --> 32:58.599
he won't be this careless.

513
33:01.200 --> 33:03.440
The time and location for this deal

514
33:04.000 --> 33:05.559
don't really match

515
33:05.880 --> 33:07.079
what we know about them.

516
33:07.440 --> 33:08.720
Also, we're not sure right now

517
33:08.880 --> 33:10.640
whether they'll change the time

518
33:10.640 --> 33:11.160
and location midway.

519
33:11.640 --> 33:14.319
Li Qiang and Liang Wenbiao are armed.

520
33:14.559 --> 33:15.799
They're extremely dangerous.

521
33:16.000 --> 33:16.880
So, Teams A and B,

522
33:17.039 --> 33:19.240
set up your positions in the lot early.

523
33:19.680 --> 33:21.640
If anything changes with the suspects,

524
33:21.839 --> 33:23.039
I'll notify you in advance.

525
33:23.599 --> 33:25.359
Both teams need to stay flexible.

526
33:26.559 --> 33:27.799
Two more things to note.

527
33:28.240 --> 33:31.039
When Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang met last time,

528
33:31.480 --> 33:32.720
a suspicious vehicle appeared.

529
33:33.480 --> 33:34.960
So during this operation,

530
33:35.440 --> 33:37.839
first, stay alert to your surroundings.

531
33:38.559 --> 33:38.920
Second,

532
33:39.400 --> 33:40.680
do not compromise your positions.

533
33:41.720 --> 33:42.880
If there are no other questions,

534
33:43.359 --> 33:43.960
let's move out.

535
35:38.400 --> 35:38.920
Brother Biao,

536
35:39.760 --> 35:41.320
If we strike it rich this time,

537
35:41.719 --> 35:43.440
aren't you taking us out to have some fun?

538
35:44.079 --> 35:44.800
Yeah, Brother Biao.

539
35:45.519 --> 35:46.480
All the goods we're moving

540
35:46.480 --> 35:48.079
come from Jiechan State.

541
35:48.519 --> 35:50.039
We should at least go check it out.

542
35:50.360 --> 35:52.119
The casinos over there are great.

543
35:52.280 --> 35:54.079
Why don't we try our luck too?

544
35:55.159 --> 35:56.079
Are you out of your mind?

545
35:56.800 --> 35:58.119
We run casinos ourselves.

546
35:58.119 --> 36:00.039
You of all people should know whether anyone wins!

547
36:02.760 --> 36:04.239
No wonder whenever I play there,

548
36:04.280 --> 36:05.360
I never win a dime.

549
36:05.480 --> 36:06.519
You rigged it!

550
36:09.599 --> 36:10.159
Brother Kai,

551
36:10.719 --> 36:12.039
you can't blame us for that.

552
36:12.280 --> 36:13.480
If you want to hold someone accountable,

553
36:13.760 --> 36:15.119
take it up with our boss.

554
36:18.320 --> 36:19.000
Ah Kai,

555
36:20.000 --> 36:21.320
we run casinos.

556
36:21.679 --> 36:23.400
All we think about is taking money from others' pockets

557
36:23.400 --> 36:25.079
and putting it into our own.

558
36:25.239 --> 36:26.320
How could the house ever lose?

559
36:29.119 --> 36:29.800
Don't worry about it.

560
36:30.199 --> 36:31.079
Next time,

561
36:31.079 --> 36:31.920
I'll let you be the dealer.

562
36:32.320 --> 36:34.119
You can win back double what you lost.

563
36:36.440 --> 36:36.920
Deal?

564
36:41.400 --> 36:41.880
Brother Biao,

565
36:42.719 --> 36:45.360
looks like a car has been tailing us.

566
36:48.119 --> 36:48.760
Really?

567
36:50.199 --> 36:50.760
Doesn't matter.

568
36:50.840 --> 36:52.280
Let them follow if they want.

569
36:53.800 --> 36:56.000
We'll take a few turns before we arrive.

570
36:57.239 --> 36:58.760
If we put on an act, we go all the way.

571
37:00.079 --> 37:00.599
Brother Biao,

572
37:01.599 --> 37:02.639
aren't we heading to a deal?

573
37:03.280 --> 37:04.480
Why put on an act?

574
37:05.599 --> 37:06.719
We are going to make a deal.

575
37:08.360 --> 37:09.519
But on this one,

576
37:10.119 --> 37:11.519
I want to make a little extra.

577
37:39.519 --> 37:40.880
Is a vehicle tailing Liang Wenbiao?

578
37:41.760 --> 37:42.199
Yes.

579
37:42.760 --> 37:44.199
But we've been tailing from a distance.

580
37:48.960 --> 37:49.599
Team A, Team B,

581
37:50.159 --> 37:51.239
report your route

582
37:51.400 --> 37:52.360
and current location.

583
37:52.360 --> 37:53.400
Team B is moving from Wenjia Lane

584
37:53.400 --> 37:54.960
onto New Town Plaza South Street.

585
37:58.000 --> 37:59.519
Team A is on Shangcheng Avenue,

586
37:59.639 --> 38:01.000
almost at New Town Plaza.

587
38:13.559 --> 38:14.000
Captain Bai.

588
38:14.400 --> 38:14.920
Captain Shen.

589
38:15.239 --> 38:16.639
Did you have someone tail Liang Wenbiao?

590
38:17.960 --> 38:19.719
All our criminal investigation officers

591
38:19.840 --> 38:21.639
are ambushing near New Oriental Plaza.

592
38:22.280 --> 38:24.000
All updates on Liang Wenbiao's movements

593
38:24.079 --> 38:25.840
were provided by your narcotics team.

594
38:26.119 --> 38:26.440
Understood.

595
38:32.239 --> 38:33.239
If it isn't Li Qiang,

596
38:34.239 --> 38:36.119
that means our previous hunch was right.

597
38:36.440 --> 38:37.920
Liang Wenbiao must have teamed up

598
38:37.920 --> 38:38.760
with someone else for this deal.

599
38:41.840 --> 38:44.000
Is it really Four-Legged Snake's crew?

600
39:05.519 --> 39:07.000
Attention all units. Attention all units.

601
39:07.400 --> 39:10.800
Liang Wenbiao's car has entered the lot.

602
39:11.199 --> 39:13.000
Current location, current location.

603
39:13.239 --> 39:16.599
Zone C, Space 137. Zone C, Space 137.

604
39:28.239 --> 39:28.679
Brother Biao,

605
39:30.079 --> 39:32.239
should we check where that kid is?

606
39:32.960 --> 39:34.239
What's the rush?

607
39:34.840 --> 39:36.960
The kid's completely spooked right now.

608
39:37.280 --> 39:40.800
He won't show up until the last minute.

609
39:54.679 --> 39:56.320
That car already showed up once earlier.

610
39:58.519 --> 39:59.000
Captain Bai,

611
39:59.719 --> 40:01.000
we've spotted a suspicious vehicle

612
40:01.559 --> 40:03.599
lingering at parking Entrance Two.

613
40:04.199 --> 40:06.039
It's a white Mazda sedan.

614
40:06.800 --> 40:10.440
Plate number Chang D24653.

615
40:11.599 --> 40:12.199
Give me Entrance B.

616
40:12.360 --> 40:12.679
Copy that.

617
40:20.519 --> 40:21.119
Head to Entrance B.

618
40:34.159 --> 40:34.719
He Bo.

619
40:35.000 --> 40:35.880
Go down and grab a bottle of water.

620
40:36.440 --> 40:37.239
Careful not to blow your cover.

621
40:37.719 --> 40:38.199
Copy that.

622
40:48.800 --> 40:49.960
This license plate is from Chang'an.

623
40:50.280 --> 40:51.559
Both Li Qiang and Four-Legged Snake

624
40:51.719 --> 40:53.079
have been spotted in Chang'an before.

625
41:02.079 --> 41:03.679
Attention, all units. Attention, all units.

626
41:04.000 --> 41:05.639
Stand by in place. Stay covered.

627
41:05.840 --> 41:06.320
Copy that.

628
41:22.400 --> 41:24.119
Brother Biao, time's up.

629
41:26.079 --> 41:27.199
What's this kid up to?

630
41:28.239 --> 41:29.400
Could he be playing us?

631
41:43.119 --> 41:44.559
What's bound to happen will happen.

632
41:46.599 --> 41:48.920
Brother Qiang, changed spots again?

633
41:49.519 --> 41:51.320
You can't keep playing hide-and-seek like this.

634
41:53.719 --> 41:55.480
Being careful is better for all of us.

635
41:56.519 --> 41:57.639
Just wait for my call.

636
41:58.000 --> 41:58.800
That's all.

637
41:59.079 --> 41:59.760
Alright.

638
42:18.239 --> 42:19.280
The deal location has changed.

639
42:20.360 --> 42:21.679
The destination is unclear right now.

640
42:24.519 --> 42:25.440
All we can do now...

641
42:25.440 --> 42:26.559
...is stay tight on the suspect.

642
42:30.599 --> 42:31.159
Teams A and B,

643
42:31.760 --> 42:32.480
get in your vehicles and stand by.

644
42:33.000 --> 42:34.519
Prepare to tail Liang Wenbiao remotely,

645
42:34.519 --> 42:35.599
and monitor the Mazda's movements.

646
42:35.760 --> 42:36.320
CID,

647
42:37.360 --> 42:39.320
pull back 10 minutes after Liang leaves.

648
42:39.519 --> 42:40.119
Stand by for orders,

649
42:40.800 --> 42:41.679
ready to back them up at any time.

650
42:42.679 --> 42:44.039
Where are we headed now, Brother Biao?

651
42:45.280 --> 42:45.800
East Street.

652
42:57.400 --> 42:58.159
Target's heading for East Street.

653
42:58.400 --> 42:59.519
Xiao Ding, pull up East Street.

654
42:59.679 --> 43:00.039
Copy that.

655
43:00.039 --> 43:00.639
All units, be advised.

656
43:00.960 --> 43:02.119
The suspect is heading toward East Street.

657
43:02.239 --> 43:02.679
Move in.

658
43:08.519 --> 43:09.880
We're behind the suspect's vehicle.

659
43:09.960 --> 43:12.199
About 50 meters from the suspect's car.

660
43:13.440 --> 43:15.159
That Mazda behind us is catching up.
